.TH CF-INSTALLATION 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf-installation.1 \- Installation and shell completion guide for cf
.PP
\fBcf\fR is built to be fast, self-contained, and zero-dependency. You can install it using \fBnpm\fR, \fBbun\fR, or build from source.
.PP
.PP
.SH 1. GLOBAL INSTALLATION
.PP
.SS "Using npm"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
npm install -g @agileguy/cf-cli
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Using bun"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
bun install -g @agileguy/cf-cli
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SH 2. VERIFY INSTALLATION
.PP
Verify the CLI binary is available on your \fB$PATH\fR:
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf --version
# Output: cf-cli v1.1.2

cf --help
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SH 3. SHELL AUTOCOMPLETIONS
.PP
\fBcf\fR includes native shell completion generators for Bash, Zsh, and Fish.
.PP
.SS "Bash"
Add completion to your \fB.bashrc\fR or \fB.bash_profile\fR:
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf completion bash >> ~/.bashrc
source ~/.bashrc
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Zsh"
Add completion to your \fB.zshrc\fR:
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf completion zsh >> ~/.zshrc
source ~/.zshrc
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Fish"
Save completion script to fish's completion directory:
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
mkdir -p ~/.config/fish/completions
cf completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/cf.fish
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SH 4. BUILDING FROM SOURCE
.PP
If you want to contribute or build the latest unreleased changes:
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/agileguy/cf-cli.git
cd cf-cli

# Install dependencies (requires Bun)
bun install

# Run the test suite
bun test

# Build the bundled executable
bun run build

# Link globally for development
bun link
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
